@startuml mill-web
title Web mill
left to right direction
actor Browser
cloud "CloudFront SPA" as CF
rectangle "Pool or local gateway" as Pool
rectangle "DATUM Gateway" as Gw
rectangle "federationcoind" as Node
rectangle "DATUM Prime" as Prime
Browser --> CF : loads app
Browser --> Pool : WSS Stratum /stratum
Pool ..> Gw
Gw --> Node : GBT submitblock
Gw --> Prime : DATUM only
note bottom of Browser
  Hasher never speaks DATUM.
  Localhost needs Apps On Device.
  Prefill ws://127.0.0.1:23335/stratum
end note
@enduml
